/-!
# Noncircular GST geometric-defect separators

An *actual missing* rational Hodge direction admits a rational linear
functional which detects it but annihilates every codimension-p point
cycle. Since the point classes generate the entire true algebraic Hodge
subspace, it also annihilates every genuine native algebraic cycle and
EVERY cycle produced from them by the realized correspondence word
engine, including genuine noncommutative commutators.

This is a mathematical frontier certificate, NOT an assumption that the
Hodge conjecture is false. It explains why algebraic-cycle-preserving
operators alone cannot prove the missing universal spanning theorem.

No custom axioms, target-cycle lifts, claimed universal nondegeneracy,
or circular geometric-generation hypotheses occur.
-/

set_option maxHeartbeats 9000000
set_option maxRecDepth 300000

noncomputable section

